        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>6\" x 34\" Oil Rubbed Bronze Kick Plate</b>\r\n<p>\r\nCommon size kick plate primarily used in residential homes, but are popular on commercial doors as well. Made of .050\" thick  solid brass. Packaged with mounting screws for easy installation. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-high-solid-brass-door-kick-plates\"><b>6\" x 34\" Kick Plates</b></a> in other finish colors\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BRA-KP-6x34-US10B-size.gif?v=1704354583\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"6\" x 34\" Oil Rubbed Bronze Kick Plate\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 34\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: .050\" (1.2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Holes: 10</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Finish:  <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li>\r\n<li>Packaged with Brass Mounting Screws</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note:</b> Kick Plates are typically the width of the door less 2 inches. If your door is 36 inches wide you would install a 34 inch wide kick plate. Please measure your door/s for proper fit.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
